            "review_text": "timbles13\nyorkshire, uk47 contributions\n0\nDirty restaurant - hair in food! Avoid!\nAug 2015 • Family\nTable cloths dirty, covered in bits & generally grubby.\nQuality of food so-so, however worse was attitude when I found a hair in my food. I had ordered a plate of fried spring rolls. There were 4 on the plate and we had one each. \nWhen I bit into mine, there was a hair inside rolled into the food.\nIt was the end of the meal. I showed the owner She became quite rude & stroppy. I told her that I did not think we should pay for the dishes a matter of principal. She said that we had eaten the rest and it was fine. She tried to say that as the food had been fried in hot oil, it was clean, no germs could have survived! \nShe insisted we pay, which we did. \nHer attitude was appalling, the hygiene was poor!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 23, 2015",
