            "review_title": "Review at Cappuccino",
            "review_text": "JoRutland\nRutland, United Kingdom3788 contributions\n0\nOne visit and it wasn't good\nMay 2015 • Friends\nFour of us ate here for dinner and based on that one visit we were not impressed. Two ordered pizza which was actually quite good. One ordered a vegetable curry which was a bowl of vegetable stock with some boiled cauliflower in it. We all tried it and it was inedible so it was returned uneaten. It bore no resemblance to a curry of any description and the waitress shouted into the kitchen as she took it away. She didn't query it when we told her it was awful and took it away without any complaint, offering another choice from the menu. The fourth order didn't arrive until we had finished our pizzas and that was ok but nothing special. The place was fairly busy everytime we passed it so perhaps we just went on a bad day, although the curry dish was spectacularly wrong and we are not fussy eaters.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 19, 2015",
